❓ FAQ
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Q: Do I need to install anything?
A: No! Just open the index.html file in any browser.

Q: Is my data saved?
A: Data persists while browser tab is open.
   Export to CSV before closing to save permanently.

Q: Can I use it offline?
A: Yes! It works completely offline (except exports).

Q: How many participants can I add?
A: Technically unlimited (browser memory dependent).
   Tested with 1000+ participants without issues.

Q: Can I use this on my phone?
A: Yes! Use local server and access from phone IP address.

Q: How do I export data?
A: Use "📥 Export Participants" or "📥 Export Teams" buttons.
   Downloads as CSV file that opens in Excel.

Q: Can I customize skills?
A: Yes! Edit the JavaScript in index.html (lines with app.skills)

Q: Is there a database version?
A: Not yet, but you can add one later using the REST API.


